<title>USA: SunSource LP Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>SunSource LP Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.20   profit	 $0.26</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,342   profit	 8,678</p>
<p> Sales		    159,737		  144,364</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.32   profit	 $1.45</p>
<p> Net profit		19,267   profit	44,116</p>
<p> Sales		    649,254		  599,865</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q4 includes non-recurring charges of about $7 million related to restructuring of technology services division and retail glass business, as well as transaction costs related to proposed conversion from partnership to corporate form.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
